        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: Express the vector \\(\\begin{pmatrix} -13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix}\\) as a linear combination of \\(\\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}\\) and \\(\\begin{pmatrix} -5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}\\).\n\nLet \\(\\begin{pmatrix} -13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix} = x \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} + y \\begin{pmatrix} -5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}\\).\n\nThis gives us the system of equations:\n\\[3x - 5y = -13,\\]\n\\[x + 2y = 3,\\]\n\\[2y = 4.\\]"
      },
