        "text": "Step 5: Use the linearity of matrix multiplication to find \\(\\mathbf{A} \\begin{pmatrix} -13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix}\\).\n\\[\\mathbf{A} \\begin{pmatrix} -13 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix} = \\mathbf{A} \\left( -1 \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} + 2 \\begin{pmatrix} -5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix} \\right) = -1 \\mathbf{A} \\begin{pmatrix} 3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} + 2 \\mathbf{A} \\begin{pmatrix} -5 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}.\\]"
